===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|beschīzen}}, from {{inh|de|goh|biskīzan}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*biskītaną}}, equivalent to {{af|de|be-|scheißen}}. Cognate with {{cog|nds-de|beschieten}}, {{cog|nl|beschijten}}, {{cog|en|beshite}}. 

